SYMEX CRASH (Invariant, symex_assign.cpp assign_from_struct:
`rhs.operands().size() == components.size()`): a NON-template auto
member function returning `__bind_back(*this, __n)` -- the
perfect-forward CTAD chain -- produces a struct assignment whose rhs
operand count differs from the type's component count.  25 lines,
header-free, clang++/g++ accept.  Split from the round-115 ranges
delta-cut (b5); siblings b2/b4 (template callers) fail earlier in the
front end and are recorded in cpp20_ranges_basic_libcxx's desc.
